9. Sub-section 1 states that an employer who wants to close down his business concern must, write to the concerned appropriate Government- (a) at least 90 days before the date of intended closure;
(b) stating reasons for such closure;
(c) undertaking that the copy of this application has been served on the representatives of the workmen.

